<%= @visitor ? "Your submission" : "New submission" %>

<% if @message -%>
<%= @message %>
<% elsif @visitor -%>
Thanks for filling in <%= @form.title || @form.handle %> on <%= site_name %>. Here's what you sent.
<% else -%>
Someone filled in <%= @form.title || @form.handle %> on <%= site_name %>. Here's what they sent.
<% end -%>
<% @rows.each do |label, value| %>

<%= label %>:
<%= value.presence || "—" %>
<% end %>
<% if @reply_to %>

Reply to this email to answer them at <%= @reply_to %>.
<% end %>
<% if @link %>

Open this submission in the Control Plane: <%= @link %>
<% end %>
